Added the preview API and review-page UI.

The new endpoint is in [route.ts](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-034/src/app/api/v1/deploy-requests/[requestId]/preview-url/route.ts) with a matching in-memory cache in [cache.ts](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-034/src/app/api/v1/deploy-requests/[requestId]/preview-url/cache.ts). It uses `withTenant`, scopes the lookup by `companyId`, resolves `headSha`/`commitSha`, calls GitHub Deployments plus deployment statuses with an app installation token fallback to `GITHUB_TOKEN`, and returns `{ previewUrl, status }` with `ready | building | not_found`.

On the page side, I added a same-file `VisualPreview` component in [page.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-034/src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx#L412) and render it after the AI summary block in the post-approval layout at [page.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-034/src/app/pp/deploy-requests/[requestId]/page.tsx#L2096). It handles loading shimmer, ready iframe, building state, not-found fallback with PR link, plus expand/collapse and external-link controls.

`npx tsc --noEmit` still fails repo-wide because of many pre-existing unrelated errors elsewhere. I verified there were no TypeScript errors reported for the new preview route or the edited review page.
